{"unit_id":"AEmbers__dsh-adjudication#card-zh","repo":"AEmbers/dsh-adjudication","commit":"5fdf0004e3a5d254e754936948988302aa0afdad","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adjudication（DSH 插件，工具客户端）：按需加载的多领域审定引擎，为代码变更和其他结构化材料提供带证据的审查流程。它在 DSH 中注册常驻领域发现、激活、规划、锚定和提交工具，并在选定领域后动态注册专属工具。主要功能包括按关键词或路径检索领域、筛选候选并分组、将发现锚定到原文、应用领域规则与损失取向、生成覆盖度报告。适合需要在 DSH 会话中调用可扩展审定流程的开发者。无需额外 API 密钥；需兼容声明的 Node.js 与 DSH 版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1295-1308","index.js:1382-1393","lib/engine.js:391-459","package.json:42-45"]}
{"unit_id":"AEmbers__dsh-adjudication#card-en","repo":"AEmbers/dsh-adjudication","commit":"5fdf0004e3a5d254e754936948988302aa0afdad","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-adjudication adds on-demand review tools to DSH. It finds domains by query or path, filters and groups candidates, anchors findings to source lines, applies domain rules, and reports coverage. Select a domain to load its tools. Requires compatible Node.js and DSH; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1295-1308","index.js:1382-1393","lib/engine.js:391-459","package.json:42-45"]}
