{"unit_id":"AEmbers__dsh-adjudication#feature-1","repo":"AEmbers/dsh-adjudication","commit":"5fdf0004e3a5d254e754936948988302aa0afdad","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adjudication 的功能「领域检索与路由」：根据用户描述或文件路径查找相关审定领域，并可按类别或已激活状态筛选。调用领域列表工具并传入 query、paths 等参数即可获得匹配结果和理由。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1297-1308","index.js:1310-1343"]}
{"unit_id":"AEmbers__dsh-adjudication#feature-2","repo":"AEmbers/dsh-adjudication","commit":"5fdf0004e3a5d254e754936948988302aa0afdad","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adjudication 的功能「按需启用领域工具」：激活某个领域时，插件才把该领域的工具注册到当前会话。调用 adjudication_activate 并提供领域 id，可选择仅入口或完整工具组。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1382-1397","index.js:569-595"]}
{"unit_id":"AEmbers__dsh-adjudication#feature-3","repo":"AEmbers/dsh-adjudication","commit":"5fdf0004e3a5d254e754936948988302aa0afdad","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adjudication 的功能「筛选并分组候选项」：审定引擎按路径、大小等闸门条件决定候选项是否纳入，并将通过的候选项组织成受控批次。规划流程触发候选筛选和分组。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/engine.js:391-480"]}
{"unit_id":"AEmbers__dsh-adjudication#feature-4","repo":"AEmbers/dsh-adjudication","commit":"5fdf0004e3a5d254e754936948988302aa0afdad","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adjudication 的功能「核对发现锚点」：将发现中的摘录与文档内容逐行匹配，定位连续匹配的起止行；无法匹配时返回未锚定结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/engine.js:99-166"]}
{"unit_id":"AEmbers__dsh-adjudication#feature-5","repo":"AEmbers/dsh-adjudication","commit":"5fdf0004e3a5d254e754936948988302aa0afdad","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adjudication 的功能「计算评审覆盖度」：根据准入候选总量和发现数量生成覆盖证明与报告，用于呈现处理范围和预算信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/engine.js:740-780"]}
{"unit_id":"AEmbers__dsh-adjudication#caveat-1","repo":"AEmbers/dsh-adjudication","commit":"5fdf0004e3a5d254e754936948988302aa0afdad","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-adjudication 使用前须知：代码评审域的 31 份规则文档仍标记为需要专家审阅，尚不能视为经专家验证的评审标准（见 domains/code-review/index.js:21-29）。","source":"generated","evidence":["domains/code-review/index.js:21-29"]}
